<title>USA: WellPoint completes Hancock acquisition.</title>
<headline>WellPoint completes Hancock acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>WellPoint Health Networks Inc said Monday that it completed its acquisition of the group health and related life businesses of John Hancock Mutual Life Insurance Co for about $86.7 million.</p>
<p>HealthPoint said the acquisition increases its size to more than 5.8 million medical members in the U.S..</p>
<p>The acquisition, which was to close January 31, had been delayed after SelectCare Inc won a preliminary injunction on a lawsuit claiming the deal would violate certain agreements between SelectCare and John Hancock.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
